-7228**tatsuo**To: haploSubj: ezoCc: sauron,mangla,silas, trout, akira, unuscione,jewelDate: Jul 29REquesting write access to patience directory.Objective: TO recode ezo and oriental areas of mud.Area to include: Ezo, Ishikawa, Iheya-Shima, unuscione's island,                 possible areas from akira and trout.Guilds involved: Ninja, Samurai(to be recoded), Wu-Jen (to be proposed)                  and Psionisist (trout/akira)People: Tatsuo, Akira, Haplo, Trout, Unuscione, and other wiz with        these interests in mind.Requirements:  I will  need general access to several directories               and at least Lord status returned.  These wizards               have worked as a team for over a year, some longer               than that (peers at haplo).  Team coding is the	        best possible way i can see to accomplish long	        term projects without usual procrastination.	        The synergy between elements allows leverage 	        for each element to accomplish his own goals.IMHO: Beelzebub is not fit for the position handed to him, it ispossible to restore the old ninja guild if we find ONE file.That file is nskills.h (NOT THE VERSION IN DICE DIRECTORY)Give me some time i will find out if I can buy the disk from Gambit, or, request herp check for backups of HM from 1993Thank you gentlemen for your consideration. The longer you ponder, the longer it takes us to complete.Tatsuo**melrin**To: troutSubj: helloCc: akiraDate: Aug 28Whats up?  I finally had the time to mud, so I thought I'd drop a lineOkay, Belly I am sorry, had to use your geneseo account to get here...Not much I could do about that...will be using it for a while untilI get used to my system.Take care you two, and email me your phone number Belly... my addressis jschihl@culver.edu.LaterTexas John**trout**To: akiraSubj: guildsDate: Sep  2	read note 32 (i think) from mangla on the inner board. I've already	mailed him telling him